<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8. </span>Partial sums of <math id="S5.F8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu_{\mathcal{T}}(n)/n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_{\mathcal{T}}(n)/n</annotation></semantics></math> up to <math id="S5.F8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10,000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>10,000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10,000</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
