<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Möbius matrices</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this appendix, we visualize the values of the two-variable Möbius function of <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="(\mathbb{N},\leq_{\mathcal{T}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">≤</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\mathbb{N},\leq_{\mathcal{T}})</annotation></semantics></math>.
